  • A balance‑bonus of {{faq_ad98a5ba_007}} per year once the account maintains an average daily balance of at least {{faq_ad98a5ba_008}} during the month;
  • A salary‑bonus of {{faq_ad98a5ba_009}} per year if a single GIRO credit of a minimum of {{faq_ad98a5ba_010}} is posted in the month.
- Any portion of the balance that exceeds {{faq_ad98a5ba_011}} million earns only the base rate of {{faq_ad98a5ba_012}} per year.
- Interest is credited to the account on the last day of each month.

